units real
dimension 3
boundary f f f

atom_style molecular
read_data two_atom_bond.data

bond_style harmonic
bond_coeff 1 50.0 1.2

thermo 10
thermo_style custom step time temp ke pe etotal

dump trajectory all custom 10 harmonic_bond.lammpstrj id type x y z vx vy vz fx fy fz

fix integrator all nve

run 500
